sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator
    participant T as Target workspace
    participant S as Source (over REST + warehouse)
    participant V as Staging volume (bundle)
    Op->>T: 00 Install Jobs (fill widgets once)
    Note over Op,T: Run "End-to-end Dry Run" (dry_run=true)
    T->>S: 01 Inventory — enumerate + read tags/ABAC/grants
    T->>S: 02 Export — SHOW CREATE DDL over source warehouse
    T->>V: write run_<id>/ (manifest + checksums)
    T->>V: 03 Import (dry) — plan only, no mutations
    T-->>Op: import.xlsx (intended actions) + preflight verdict
    Note over Op,T: Reports clean & preflight GO → go live
    Op->>T: Run "End-to-end Live" (dry_run=false)
    T->>T: create + govern in dependency order (fail-closed)
    T-->>Op: import.xlsx + Outstanding sheet + uc_sync_state
